# RS-ROLE and RS-R4 (ops/store.ops) from ada's second terminal: the session's request, then `kern true` (one
# approval, the hold on window 1; no other ask until the terminal ends), then the rest; every answer and status as
# the table says, so the terminal ends with status 0. No passphrase reaches the transcript.
hdesk: accounts 2
hdesk: login ada uid 1000
hdesk: terminal 1 slot 1
hdesk: approval ask want 8 uid 1000
hdesk: approved by ada
hdesk: kern 1 pid
-hdesk: approval ask
=hdesk: terminal 1 ended, status 0
hdesk: logout ada
!sevenhorsesrun
!sam-pass
!sam-long-passphrase
!ivy-pass
